kunzite: Goodix GT9916K (Berlin-D) on SPI QUP1 SE3, GENI FIFO mode, polled; RPMh L7E
for AVDD. Regenerated over the merged series (files entry, call site and its extern
re-derived; the kunzite_touch.c body is carried over unchanged).

